<title>UK: Ultra buys Flightline for $12.5 million.</title>
<headline>Ultra buys Flightline for $12.5 million.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Ultra Electronics Holdings Plc said on Friday that it has bought U.S. firm Flightline Electronics Inc for $12.5 million in cash.</p>
<p>The aerospace and defence electronics group said in a statement that New York-based Flightline will be part of its Air Systems sector.</p>
<p>&quot;This acquisition is part of our continuing strategy to grow Ultra's presence in the North American market where we see significant future opportunities,&quot; said Ultra chairman Julian Blogh.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
